# Environment variables — NEVER commit .env with real secrets.
# ENT-X1 = A ("never shared"): `.env*` also covers `.env.bak-*`, the shape the
# 2026-10-21 incident produced (index §h). The tracked `.env.example` templates
# are re-included explicitly — the negation has no slash on purpose, so it also
# re-includes `frontend/.env.example`.
.env*
!.env.example
.meta-config/secrets.local.yaml


